WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:01.534
♪ (SOMBER PIANO MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:01.767 --> 00:00:03.836
SPEAKER:<i> DOS is a monolithic
 and ruthless group</i>

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:07.040
<i> masquerading as a group
designed to liberate women.</i>

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:10.510
SPEAKER 2:<i> I was just thinking,
 like, where are we?</i>

00:00:10.576 --> 00:00:11.778
<i> How did we get here?</i>

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:14.114
SPEAKER 3:
<i> This has to be stopped.</i>

00:00:15.314 --> 00:00:17.584
SPEAKER 4:<i> So I heard Keith
hasn't been seen for weeks.</i>

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:19.886
<i> I'm pretty sure
 he's on the run.</i>

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:23.022
NEWS ANCHOR:<i> Keith Raniere
is charged with sex trafficking,</i>

00:00:23.155 --> 00:00:26.026
<i> racketeering,
sexual exploitation of children.</i>

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:31.964
KEITH RANIERE:<i> By being able
to do the most distasteful
 of activities,</i>

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:34.567
<i> you're going to be
 the agent of change.</i>

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:39.972
Imagine you spent 22 years
trying to build something,

00:00:40.439 --> 00:00:43.542
<i> but everybody thinks
 it's the devil's work.</i>

00:00:43.642 --> 00:00:46.278
SPEAKER 5:<i> People didn't stay
because they were coerced.</i>

00:00:46.412 --> 00:00:48.647
<i> They stayed in it
because they really thought</i>

00:00:48.714 --> 00:00:51.550
<i> they were making society
 and the world better.</i>

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:52.852
That's just next level.

00:00:53.453 --> 00:00:57.457
His intent was never about doing
anything good for any woman.

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:59.325
SPEAKER 6:
<i>Keith is very dear to me,</i>

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:00.793
<i>and I know he's innocent.</i>

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:04.430
RANIERE:<i> You know the best way
 to train a con artist?</i>

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:07.534
<i> Let the games
 that they play work.</i>

